output-name                          |   string       |  optional   |   valor_pdf
mesg-thresholds                      |   string       |  optional   |   verbosity.xml
pot-override                         |   double       |  optional   |   -999
force-dst,no-force-dst               |   boolean_list |  optional   |   no-force-dst
